    <item>
      <title>Teaching</title>
      <link></link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid></guid>
      <description>&lt;figure class=&#34;text-end&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;blockquote class=&#34;blockquote fs-6&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;&#34;At the higher level, the teacher does not exist for the sake of the student;&#xA;    both teacher and student have their justification in the common pursuit&#xA;    of knowledge.&#34;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&#xA;&lt;figcaption class=&#34;blockquote-footer&#34;&gt;&#xA;    Wilhelm von Humboldt&#xA;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&#xA;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;With 14 years of experience in teaching theoretical philosophy, I have&#xA;taught BA and MA lectures and seminars in logic, epistemology, and metaphysics,&#xA;as well as the philosophies of language, mind, science. My teaching career&#xA;includes positions at the &lt;i class=&#34;bi bi-box-arrow-up-right h-6&#34;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&#xA;&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.uni-muenster.de/en/&#34;&#xA;  class=&#34;link-dark&#34; rel=&#34;external&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34;&gt;University of&#xA;Münster&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;, &lt;i class=&#34;bi bi-box-arrow-up-right h-6&#34;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&#xA;&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.lmu.de/en/&#34;&#xA;  class=&#34;link-dark&#34; rel=&#34;external&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34;&gt;LMU Munich&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;,&#xA;and &lt;i class=&#34;bi bi-box-arrow-up-right h-6&#34;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&#xA;&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.uu.nl&#34;&#xA;  class=&#34;link-dark&#34; rel=&#34;external&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34;&gt;Utrecht University&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Service</title>
      <link></link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid></guid>
      <description>&lt;figure class=&#34;text-end&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;blockquote class=&#34;blockquote fs-6&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;&#34;The acquisition of wealth is no longer the driving force in our lives. We work&#xA;to better ourselves and the rest of humanity.&#34;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&#xA;&lt;figcaption class=&#34;blockquote-footer&#34;&gt;&#xA;    Jean-Luc Picard&#xA;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&#xA;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;I&amp;rsquo;m an associate editor at the &lt;i class=&#34;bi bi-box-arrow-up-right h-6&#34;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&#xA;&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.springer.com/journal/10992/&#34;&#xA;  class=&#34;link-dark&#34; rel=&#34;external&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34;&gt;Journal of Philosophical&#xA;Logic&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;If you&amp;rsquo;re an editor looking for a referee in my AOS, I&amp;rsquo;m game.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;I&amp;rsquo;m interested in open source, open access, and changing the academic&#xA;publication system.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;I&amp;rsquo;m support the following institutions:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;i class=&#34;bi bi-box-arrow-up-right h-6&#34;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&#xA;&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.wikipedia.org/&#34;&#xA;  class=&#34;link-dark&#34; rel=&#34;external&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34;&gt;Wikipedia&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;i class=&#34;bi bi-box-arrow-up-right h-6&#34;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&#xA;&lt;a href=&#34;https://gap-im-netz.de/en/&#34;&#xA;  class=&#34;link-dark&#34; rel=&#34;external&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34;&gt;GAP&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;i class=&#34;bi bi-box-arrow-up-right h-6&#34;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&#xA;&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.dgphil.de/&#34;&#xA;  class=&#34;link-dark&#34; rel=&#34;external&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34;&gt;DGPhil&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;i class=&#34;bi bi-box-arrow-up-right h-6&#34;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&#xA;&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.verenigingvoorlogica.nl/nl/&#34;&#xA;  class=&#34;link-dark&#34; rel=&#34;external&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34;&gt;VvL&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;</description>
    </item>
